      "id": "claim_20c37b9465094c39b16ba9dde719638b",
      "statement": "A strategy enters the library as CANDIDATE with its numbers visible but is not eligible for deployment or full agent autonomy; promotion to VALIDATED requires every control to pass, and a control returning None for insufficient or degenerate data leaves the strategy a CANDIDATE.",
