      "statement": "Gate failure is rendered rather than hidden: each control shows as PASS with its value, FAIL with the value and the threshold, or MISSING, and the UI shows this for candidates and validated strategies alike, with paper-claim deltas surfaced alongside instead of collapsed into an aggregate score.",
