      "statement": "Two exceptions to the gate are permitted and both are documented reviewer decisions rather than threshold weakening: a measured diversification benefit against a marginally lower DSR, and an uncomputable CPCV on a short but sound series — in both cases the number is never altered, the decision is documented, and the caveat is visible on the passport.",
